Subject: harness cases for branches the stage-3 audit found untested

Test only: no kernel source changes (amix-dlm docs/plan/stage-3-audit-
2026-10-26.md section 2.5).  The interrupt chains' error returns (ENXIO
before the walk is armed, ECONFIG on a full chain, EINVAL at a bad level)
and the order of stock and module handlers on both levels; marc_post
loading a boot member's dependency first; modstat reporting a pinned
module locked.

--- a/test/mkmods.py
+++ b/test/mkmods.py
@@ -210,4 +210,5 @@
 # matches a board this box lacks, pdm is demand class on major 67
 mod('pb1')
 mod('pb2')
+mod('pb3', 'pb1')                   # depends on pb1: pb1 loads first
 mod('pdm')
--- a/test/state.c
+++ b/test/state.c
@@ -500,7 +500,16 @@
 
